    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a script for this new urban crime drama. it's supposed to be super gritty and realistic, like a hard-hitting police procedural. i need some help brainstorming character archetypes for the cast. can you suggest some different archetypes for both the inner-city detectives and the criminals that would feel authentic to that kind of setting?",
