    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For the detectives, you should have a grizzled, world-weary veteran who's seen it all, and maybe a young, ambitious rookie who's too eager. On the criminal side, you need a slick, intelligent leader, and a more desperate, street-level hustler. These archetypes will give you the necessary tension between the established order and the chaotic elements of the city.",
